      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      According to Proposition <a href="/tag/B62F20" data-tag="B62F20">4.4.2.6</a>, it suffices to prove this result for pullbacks and small products. In the case of products, we apply Proposition <a href="/tag/EEB9CC" data-tag="EEB9CC">6.3.2.1</a>. For pullbacks, we use Proposition <a href="/tag/6D72E6" data-tag="6D72E6">6.3.2.2</a> and Theorem <a href="/tag/EB2834" data-tag="EB2834">4.2.4.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
